  "semantic": {
    "lines": [
      "You've accomplished the 5 most difficult quest",
      "ever. We look forward to see your help on",
      "",
      "future Igolanos' attack. Well this time we will",
      "reward you a Royal weapon.",
      "",
      "You can choose one item from these 8 weapons.",
      "You can simply click on a weapon to see it's spec.",
      "",
      "By the way, you must empty your inventory weight ",
      "at least 60 for the weapon.",
      "=============================================",
      "*1. Axe - Minotaur Axe",
      "*2. Claw - Extream Talon",
      "*3. Mace - Dragon Bone Hammer",
      "*4. Pike - Hellfire Scythe",
      "*5. Bow - Revenge Bow",
      "*6. Sword - Immortal Sword",
      "*7. Javelin - Salamander Javelin",
      "*8. Wand/Staff - Gothic Staff"
    ]
  },
